  "2026-08-14T23:25:37.745Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-15: active in the coupled workspace-integrity tranche spanning provenance repair, self-indexing health severity, extension-host version coherence, cross-version history repair, and strict linked-artifact parsing. Only these five canonical regression items are claimed; all other tracker work remains open and unclaimed."
  "2026-08-15T01:56:44.813Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence 2026-08-15: the SDK now inventories extension-host pm-cli copies across npm, pnpm, and other dependency layouts, reports mismatches with privacy-safe relative paths, and integrates host-version skew into health findings and gate failure semantics. Focused linked tests passed 64/64; full release verification passed 7,334 tests and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage."
  "2026-08-15T02:27:13.575Z","harness:codex","Coordination correction 2026-08-15: PR #1016 compact finding-retention review belongs to canonical self-indexing health item pm-larv4r; no new extension-host census change is being made under this item."
  "2026-08-15T03:38:28.633Z","harness:codex","Review follow-up 2026-08-15: CodeRabbit found that all external extension manifests collapse to the same privacy-safe display path. Reopened the canonical extension-host census item to add deterministic opaque per-installation identity without disclosing raw host paths."
  "2026-08-15T03:59:03.532Z","harness:codex","Review fix evidence: external pm-cli manifests now receive deterministic 64-bit opaque installation fingerprints, distinct copies remain distinct, raw host paths are absent, and no crypto import is added to the governance entrypoint. The SDK import-cost gate passes."
  "2026-08-15T04:00:01.902Z","harness:codex","Final exact-head evidence: linked extension/health contracts passed 64/64; deterministic privacy-safe external identities are distinct and stable; SDK entrypoint import-cost and repository static gates pass; full coverage is exact."
